  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">非官方延续自 Grondag 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clear-skies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clear Skies</a>，<em>移除了原版 Minecraft 地平线处的天空分层现象</em>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">开启后</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/257/854/with-day.png\" alt=\"开启后\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">关闭后</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/257/853/without-day.png\" alt=\"关闭后\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\"></p>",
